Test pure lambdas (no capture):

Test 1 - Arithmetic lambda:
  add(10, 5) = 15
  multiply(10, 5) = 50
  subtract(10, 5) = 5

Test 2 - Conditional lambda:
  max(10, 20) = 20
  min(10, 20) = 10

Test 3 - Boolean lambda:
  is_even(4) = true
  is_even(7) = false
  is_positive(5) = true
  is_positive(-3) = false

Test 4 - String lambda:
  Hello, World!
  Hello, Sn!

Test 5 - Double lambda:
  half(10.0) = 5.00000
  square(5.0) = 25.00000

Test 6 - Lambda composition:
  double(increment(5)) = 12

All pure lambda tests passed!
